---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Eventina Organisers"
  description="Official Terms of Use for Eventina Organisers — Intellectual property, consultation estimates, and governing jurisdiction."
  canonicalURL="https://eventina.in/terms"
>
  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <section class="page-hero-compact" style="padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); background: var(--color-navy-950); color: var(--color-text-inverse); text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 146, 66, 0.2);">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-gold-400); display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Legal &amp; Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="page-title" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">
        Terms of Use
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle" style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-text-inverse-muted); font-family: var(--font-eyebrow); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); text-transform: uppercase;">
        Last updated: October 2026 &bull; Compliant with Indian DPDP Act and International Standards
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Legal Body Content -->
  <section class="section legal-content-section">
    <div class="container container-prose" style="max-width: 820px; margin-inline: auto;">
      <div class="legal-card-body card" style="padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-200); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); line-height: 1.8;">
        
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          1. Acceptance of Terms
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          By browsing, accessing, or utilizing <a href="https://eventina.in" style="color: var(--color-gold-700); text-decoration: underline;">eventina.in</a>, you signify your unreserved concurrence with these Terms of Use. If you disagree with any segment of these clauses, please discontinue interaction with this website.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          2. Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          All brand crests, editorial narratives, creative palettes, floral scenography imagery, and architectural documentation showcased across this platform are the proprietary intellectual assets of Eventina Organisers or licensed from credited collaborators. Reproduction, unauthorized scraping, or syndication is strictly prohibited without explicit written assent.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          3. Website Content &amp; Scope of Estimates
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          Visual previews, sample timelines, and published price estimates represent indicative planning frameworks. Formal binding engagements arise solely upon the execution of a definitive bespoke event service agreement and receipt of the requisite mobilisation advance.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          4. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          While Eventina strives for uninterrupted accuracy across all published material, this site is presented on an "as is" and "as available" foundation without warranties of merchantability or specific fitness. We disclaim liability for indirect or consequential damages arising from site access or reliance upon sample copy.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-2xl); color: var(--color-navy-950); margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
          5. Governing Law and Jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
          These Terms shall be interpreted and governed in accordance with the substantive laws of the Republic of India. Any legal dispute or proceeding arising under these provisions shall remain subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in Bengaluru, Karnataka.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
